# Fixtures in tests/fb12/ that this compiler gets wrong today, one per line:
# <fixture> R13-0[b]#NN P0|P1|P2 <one-line symptom>
#
# Same contract as tests/difftest.knownfail, tests/difftest.com.knownfail and
# tests/c99.knownfail: a listed fixture may fail, and a listed fixture that
# starts PASSING is a FAILURE -- closing a defect means deleting its line.
